      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Glad to see this. Users in my Discord server regularly open tickets asking for an 18+ role and provide links to their VRC profiles. Now that I can't see the verified 18+ title / badge on the website I can't easily verify via this method.\n\nI was able to read up on the VRC API docs and I can still get the data for age verification (\"ageVerificationStatus\"). The data for the age verified badge is still there in the back end response but it seams that it's just not on the website. I might continue with this method.\n\nQuick edit: My friend told me about VRCX and it shows the badge. Copy user's ID and click \"Direct Access\" in VRCX. It automatically shows the users profile with the age verified badge! This works nicely for the time being.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
