      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This needs to be corrected.\n\nGroup moderation/admin needs to have easy access to seeing this 18+ verified status. \n\nIf VRC Mods are going to be throwing rods from god to destroy people's groups callously when users dare not use the PAID VERIFICATION SERVICE effectively...   maybe make sure we can interact with the feature if you're going to force us to buy into.\n\nSeems important that it be working at full strength since there's financial attachment to it.",
